{"unit_id":"haimuhaimu__dsh-persona#card-zh","repo":"haimuhaimu/dsh-persona","commit":"3730dfbfcc6df69120f4383d833d2a7e31d15989","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的人设与记忆插件，通过 agent/pre-step 将当前人设提示和近期记忆注入请求，并注册工具供用户列举、切换和管理人设。它内置三种角色，也支持配置自定义角色；每个人设的记忆彼此独立，可跨会话保存、检索和删除。适合希望固定助手表达风格、按任务切换角色，并延续偏好或项目背景的 DSH 用户。首次默认使用安若童人设，状态和记忆保存在本地文件中，无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:117-163","index.js:166-420","personas.js:19-76","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"haimuhaimu__dsh-persona#card-en","repo":"haimuhaimu/dsh-persona","commit":"3730dfbfcc6df69120f4383d833d2a7e31d15989","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-persona adds switchable personas and cross-session memory to DeepSeek Harness. It injects prompts and recent notes before requests, with tools to switch roles and manage separate memories. Three built-in and custom roles are supported; local files preserve state. No extra key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:117-163","index.js:166-420","personas.js:19-76","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
