{"unit_id":"haimuhaimu__dsh-persona#feature-persona-switch","repo":"haimuhaimu/dsh-persona","commit":"3730dfbfcc6df69120f4383d833d2a7e31d15989","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona 的功能「切换人设」：列出内置或自定义角色，并通过工具按 id 切换当前助手风格；选择会写入状态文件，重新启动后仍可恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:166-258"]}
{"unit_id":"haimuhaimu__dsh-persona#feature-persona-memory-inject","repo":"haimuhaimu/dsh-persona","commit":"3730dfbfcc6df69120f4383d833d2a7e31d15989","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona 的功能「记忆注入」：在 agent 请求前把当前角色提示和近期记忆加入上下文；按角色和记忆版本去重，切换或更新记忆后可重新注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:148-163"]}
