{"unit_id":"haimuhaimu__dsh-persona#feature-custom-personas","repo":"haimuhaimu/dsh-persona","commit":"3730dfbfcc6df69120f4383d833d2a7e31d15989","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona 的功能「自定义人设」：通过配置添加带 id、名称、简介和提示词的角色，之后可与内置人设一样列出并切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:117-130"]}
